--- !u!114 &669360703
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 669360700}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "And then, while I was packing my backpack, it felt Then, she turns around.
    She looks at me all sly, squinting, and says: 'Why are you so spooked? Drawing
    porn in your notebook?' I nearly swallowed my tongue. She just laughs: 'We\u2019re
    going to the \"Cosmos\" cinema after school to see Lips of Lies. It\u2019s a
    movie about a mask that rips out the tongues of anyone who lies. My friends and
    I have an extra ticket. You coming? Or are you afraid they\u2019ll bite your
    tongue off too?'\n\nI just nodded. And now I\u2019m thinking: Did she see the
    drawing? Was it her who came over? My hands are still shaking; I can barely hold
    my pen. What a fucking loser I am... \nlike a wire was pulled tight inside my
    head. And I heard her. Our Principal\u2019s voice\u2014but not the one she uses
    to scream at assemblies about indoor shoes and discipline. This voice was right
    inside my skull\u2014quiet, cold as ice.\r\n\r\n'Get it together,' she said.
    'Don't be a piece of shit. YOU must stand tall. Your shame is just an error.
    AND I WILL FIX IT. You are above all this trash around you.'\r\n\r\nI just froze
    there by the coat rack. Suddenly, I didn't give a damn about anything, and that
    in itself was creepy. All those thoughts about 'who saw the notebook' became
    tiny, like dust under a wardrobe. It was right. I have to go to the movies. But
    not as some pathetic loser\u2014I\u2019m going to see how this world is really
    put together."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 45ae1b20a8af0b947bf46692f07a66b7, type: 2}
