--- !u!114 &1971493364
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1971493361}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "During the break, everyone was just yapping about that fire at the cinema
    where they were screening The Matrix last week. I couldn't have given less of
    a fuck. Whether it was them or just breakfast sitting wrong, I don't know. I
    bought a packet of Yupi at the cafeteria and dumped the powder straight onto
    my tongue\u2014sour, burning... No, wait... It\u2019s still burning. Bitch.\r\nThen
    I remember the little kids from the primary grades spilling their wooden alphabet
    BLOCKS in the hallway. I looked down at them and suddenly realized I couldn't
    read what was written there. It was like the letters were just a bunch of sticks
    and hooks that didn't mean anything. On top of that, the principal started screaming
    at the little shits.<align=center><size=150%>\nA strange feeling...</size></align>\n<size=60%>Sometimes
    it feels like I\u2019m not even a person, just some kind of broadcast that nobody\u2019s
    watching. Like I\u2019m transparent. Fuck, what kind of horseshit am I writing?
    I\u2019m reading this back and I want to rip my own hands off. What\u2019s with
    all the whining? Who the hell needs this?</size><align=right>\r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 45ae1b20a8af0b947bf46692f07a66b7, type: 2}
